/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (PeraBots 2026 is the flagship annual robotics competition organized by the Electrical and Electronic Engineering Society \(EEES\), Department of Electrical and Electronic Engineering, University of Peradeniya, in collaboration with the Robotics Society of the University of Peradeniya. The competition aims to promote innovation, creativity, and practical engineering skills by providing participants with an opportunity to design, program, and develop autonomous robotic systems. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
154 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (PeraBots 2026 features separate School and University categories, enabling participants of different experience levels to engage in robotics challenges appropriate to their academic background. Through a combination of simulation-based activities, practical implementation, and technical learning opportunities, the competition seeks to inspire the next generation of engineers, innovators, and technology enthusiasts while fostering collaboration among educational institutions across Sri Lanka.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
