156 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/E (The PeraBots 2026 School Category is designed to introduce students to the fundamentals of autonomous robotics through a progressive, hands-on learning experience. Participants will develop the skills required to design, program, and implement autonomous robotic systems capable of sensing their surroundings, making decisions, and completing assigned tasks. The competition combines virtual simulation with practical hardware implementation, encouraging students to transform theoretical concepts into real-world engineering solutions while fostering creativity, teamwork, and problem-solving abilities. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
